    {
      "text": "for α > 1 so that it reaches clean data earlier, and the linear offset ho holds the lagging stream at pure noise",
      "section_id": "sec:framework",
      "page_start": 5,
      "page_end": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "video-lead and action-lead regimes, and (α, o) = (1, 0) recovers the synchronized diagonal exactly: synchronous",
      "section_id": "sec:framework",
      "page_start": 5,
      "page_end": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "OpenWAM-Infra therefore also defines a unified action space u ∈R80 with fixed slot semantics: two mirrored",
